<title>SWITZERLAND: SOCCER-AJAX 1 GRASSHOPPER 0 - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AJAX 1 GRASSHOPPER 0 - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ajax Amsterdam of the Netherlands beat Grasshopper Zurich of Switzerland 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in their European Cup Champions' League group A match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Patrick Kluivert 31.</p>
<p>Attendance: 22,000</p>
